{"id":"57108f066c5d47ce","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-resolution-derivation.md","title":"任意子句的归结推导与闭包","display":"df-resolution-derivation — 任意子句的归结推导与闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-resolution-derivation","aliases":["72-df-resolution-derivation"],"display":"df-resolution-derivation — 任意子句的归结推导与闭包","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Definition1.3.2 and Theorem1.3.4, print19–21/PDF31–33; explicit local closure","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-resolution-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-resolution-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolution-derivation — 任意子句的归结推导与闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Definition1.3.2 and Theorem1.3.4, print19–21/PDF31–33; explicit local closure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Clause},\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\">\\(\\mathsf{Clause},\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(F,G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span> 为有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}\\)</span> 是有限序列长度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n(F)\">\\(R_n(F)\\)</span> 按自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 递归引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=C\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\ \\bigl[\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists l\\in\\pi_j\\\n(\\overline l\\in\\pi_k\\land\\pi_i=\\operatorname{Res}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,l))\\bigr],\\\\\nR_0(F)&amp;:=F,\\\\\nR_{n+1}(F)&amp;:=R_n(F)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Res}(C_1,C_2,l):C_1,C_2\\in R_n(F),\\ l\\in C_1,\\ \\overline l\\in C_2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R_n(F),\\\\\nC\\in\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=C\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\ \\bigl[\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists l\\in\\pi_j\\\n(\\overline l\\in\\pi_k\\land\\pi_i=\\operatorname{Res}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,l))\\bigr],\\\\\nR_0(F)&amp;:=F,\\\\\nR_{n+1}(F)&amp;:=R_n(F)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Res}(C_1,C_2,l):C_1,C_2\\in R_n(F),\\ l\\in C_1,\\ \\overline l\\in C_2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R_n(F),\\\\\nC\\in\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向对闭包阶段归纳，先串接两个父子句的有限推导，再添加归结行；逆向对推导行归纳，每个父行处于某个有限阶段，取两个阶段的最大值再加一。根子句为空时，推导条件恰与既有反驳定义一致。该接口不加入削弱规则；闭包只由输入子句和真实归结生成。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Clause},\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；$F,G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}$ 为有限集合，$C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}$，$\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Clause},\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}","display":false},{"tex":"R_n(F)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C)&:\\Longleftrightarrow0<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=C\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\ \\bigl[\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\ \\exists l\\in\\pi_j\\\n(\\overline l\\in\\pi_k\\land\\pi_i=\\operatorname{Res}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,l))\\bigr],\\\\\nR_0(F)&:=F,\\\\\nR_{n+1}(F)&:=R_n(F)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Res}(C_1,C_2,l):C_1,C_2\\in R_n(F),\\ l\\in C_1,\\ \\overline l\\in C_2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R_n(F),\\\\\nC\\in\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2206,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-derivation|df-resolution-derivation — 任意子句的归结推导与闭包]]"},{"id":"79c50f49bb7604ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,G$、$\\operatorname{ResCl},\\operatorname{ResDer},\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 同 [[72-df-resolution-derivation]]；$G\\subseteq\\operatorname{ResCl}(F)$，且 $G$ 有限。"},{"id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}$，$\\operatorname{ResDer}(\\pi,F,C)$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-derivation]] 的任意末子句版本。"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135"]}